<title>PHILIPPINES: BASKETBALL-PHILIPPINE PRO-LEAGUE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BASKETBALL-PHILIPPINE PRO-LEAGUE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-08-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of semi-final round games on Friday in the Philippine Basketball Association second conference, which includes American players:</p>
<p>Alaska Milk beat Purefoods Hotdogs 103-95 (34-48 half-time)</p>
<p>Ginebra San Miguel beat Shell 120-103 (65-56)</p>
</text>
